    "id": "R7",
    "title": "GTA 6 was first planned across two continents",
    "caption": "GTA 6 was first planned across parts of two continents 🌎\n\nCode name: Project Americas. Big chunks of North AND South America, Bloomberg reported.\nThen Rockstar cut it right back to one city and the land around it. Why? Bloomberg doesn't say.\nAnd the \"small\" version is still huge: Vice City alone is twice the size of Los Santos, per Rockstar.\nThe research? A 2015 Miami trip that turned into a decade of coming back. They interviewed respected people from every kind of neighbourhood and hired some.\nOne state, 11 years from first trip to launch (our math). Now imagine two continents 🤯\n\nTwo continents or one insanely detailed state, which would you pick?\n\n#GTA6 #GTA #GameDev #Miami #VideoGames",
    "pinned_comment": "Hot take: Project Americas would've been mid. One insanely detailed state was the right call. Agree?",
    "alt_hook": "GTA 6 started as Project Americas, planned across parts of two continents.",
